DMAX EV Motors Sales & Profit Dashboard
Overview

This project is an interactive Power BI dashboard developed using real EV showroom sales data from DMAX EV Motors. The dashboard provides comprehensive insights into sales performance, profitability, customer activity, and inventory trends to support data-driven business decisions.

Features
Analyzed showroom sales data to monitor revenue, profit, customer activity, and units sold.
Cleaned and transformed raw sales and billing data using Power Query.
Created KPI cards for Total Sales, Total Profit, Units Sold, and Customer Count.
Developed product-wise sales analysis, payment mode analysis, and salesperson performance reports using DAX.
Implemented interactive filters for City, Product, and Delivery Status for dynamic reporting.
Generated business insights to support sales tracking, inventory planning, and performance evaluation.
Tools & Technologies
Power BI
Power Query
DAX
Excel
Data Visualization
Dashboard Insights

The dashboard enables users to:

Monitor overall sales and profit performance.
Analyze product and salesperson performance.
Evaluate customer purchasing trends.
Track payment methods and delivery status.
Support business decisions through interactive visualizations.
